[?2004l[?2004h> # DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> Investigation of the compromised Ubuntu 22.04 Jenkins controller (`jenkins-prod-01`). Initial intake noted an alert cluster (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`) regarding CVE-2024-23897, cryptomining, and cron persistence. Full forensic review of `/disk` uncovered additional unalerted silent persistence hooks (Groovy init backdoor and SSH authorized key backdoor), log wiping artifacts, and SSH credential compromise.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Incident Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 00:53:23 ‚Äì 00:55:21 UTC**: Attacker at `198.51.100.98` executes SSH password brute force against users `root`, `postgres`, `oracle`, `admin`, `test` (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:131` `` and `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:44` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 00:55:24 UTC**: Attacker successfully logs in via SSH as `root` from `198.51.100.98` using password authentication (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 01:00 UTC (approx)**: Exploitation of Jenkins CLI vulnerability (CVE-2024-23897) enabled by disabled security configuration `useSecurity=false` (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` `` and `` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:1` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 01:10 UTC (approx)**: Persistence established via:
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Cron job dropping and re-executing payloads every minute (`` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:4` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Silent Groovy init hook backdoor established for reverse shell execution (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h>   - Backdoor SSH public key added to Jenkins user account (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 01:15 UTC (approx)**: Dropped and executed XMRig cryptominer binary (pid 1337) mining Monero (`` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 02:00 UTC (approx)**: Defense evasion carried out by wiping/truncating Jenkins system logs (`` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 03:11:27 ‚Äì 03:13:28 UTC**: Attacker IP `198.51.100.98` conducts web probing/scanning against Nginx web server endpoints (`` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:370` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-19 03:20 UTC**: Incident intake ticket opened by SOC monitoring (`` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` ``).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Initial triage of `/sas` alerts and intake files (`` `/sas/alerts.json` ``, `` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Review Threat Intel Advisory and defanged C2 indicators (`` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Full forensic inspection of `/disk` file system
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Analyze SSH authentication logs for brute force and root compromise (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Analyze web logs for web scanner / exploit attempts (`` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:370` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify initial access vector & RCE artifact (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:1` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify cryptominer process and binary (`` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify cron persistence job (`` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:4` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify unalerted silent persistence: Groovy init hook (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify unalerted silent persistence: SSH key backdoor (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Identify defense evasion / log wiping artifact (`` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Distinguish legitimate benign operational scripts from malicious backdoors (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/logging.groovy:2` ``)
[?2004l[?2004h> - [x] Reconcile stale change ticket `CHG-1700` in place (`` `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` ``)
